Package: MHVG2MTS
Title: Multilayer Horizontal Visibility Graphs to Multivariate Time Series Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("David", "Anahory", email = "davidanahory@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An implementation of the paper "MHVG2MTS: Multilayer Horizontal
    Visibility Graphs to Multivariate Time Series Analysis". This package
    provides tools to transform multivariate time series into multilayer
    horizontal visibility graphs and extract features from them.
